00:11:14,029 --> 00:11:16,432
Nitapenda kuangalia Jumamosi.

236
00:11:16,456 --> 00:11:19,462
Unaweza kuangalia wakati wowote.

237
00:11:19,486 --> 00:11:23,381
Nitakuja Jumamosi hii saa nne asubuhi.

238
00:11:23,404 --> 00:11:28,138
Tafadhali njoo kwenye dirisha saa tatu na robo asubuhi.

239
