240
00:11:30,258 --> 00:11:31,825
Ndiyo,

241
00:11:31,848 --> 00:11:36,621
Tafadhali andika jina na nambari ya simu yako kwenye karatasi hii.

242
00:11:36,645 --> 00:11:39,616
Jina na nambari ya simu, ndiyo.

243
00:11:39,639 --> 00:11:41,806
Nimeandika.

244
00:11:41,829 --> 00:11:43,429
Asante sana.

245
00:11:43,452 --> 00:11:46,629
Ninangoja kwa hamu kwenda darasani.

246
00:11:46,652 --> 00:11:50,019
Tujifunze Kijapani kwa furaha.

247
00:11:50,042 --> 00:11:53,209
Je, naweza kuja pamoja na rafiki?

248
00:11:53,233 --> 00:11:54,866
Ndiyo,

249
00:11:54,889 --> 00:11:57,184
Tafadhali njooni pamoja na rafiki.

250
00:11:57,208 --> 00:11:58,902
Asante sana.

251
00:11:58,925 --> 00:12:02,658
Nitakungojia Jumamosi.

252
00:12:02,681 --> 00:12:03,681
Ndiyo,

253
00:12:03,704 --> 00:12:05,985
Nitakuja Jumamosi.

254
00:12:06,009 --> 00:12:07,862
Kwa heri.

255
00:12:07,885 --> 00:12:09,385
Sehemu ya 6: Kuhifadhi mizigo kwenye treni ya Shinkansen / Kanuni za Kuhifadhi Mizigo Shinkansen

256
00:12:09,385 --> 00:12:12,919
Umeangalia habari za asubuhi?

257
00:12:12,942 --> 00:12:16,075
Hapana, sijawaona.

258
00:12:16,098 --> 00:12:20,331
Habari mpya kuhusu mizigo mikubwa kwenye Shinkansen.

259
00:12:20,354 --> 00:12:22,888
Ni habari gani?

260
00:12:22,911 --> 00:12:27,890
Suitcase kubwa zinahitaji uhifadhi wa mapema.

261
00:12:27,913 --> 00:12:31,331
