Shilingi elfu moja ni ghali, sivyo?

266
00:12:45,033 --> 00:12:48,600
Ndiyo, angalia vizuri.

267
00:12:48,624 --> 00:12:51,500
Nafanya uhifadhi wapi?

268
00:12:51,524 --> 00:12:54,800
Unaweza kufanya uhifadhi kwenye dirisha.

269
00:12:54,823 --> 00:12:59,057
