272
00:13:06,243 --> 00:13:10,510
Ndiyo, unaweza kufanya uhifadhi hata kwa simu yako.

273
00:13:10,533 --> 00:13:13,699
Mizigo nitaiweka wapi?

274
00:13:13,722 --> 00:13:17,335
Nyuma ya kiti cha mwisho.

275
00:13:17,359 --> 00:13:21,126
Kiti cha mizigo mikubwa, ndiyo?

276
00:13:21,149 --> 00:13:24,715
Ndiyo, kiti hicho.

277
00:13:24,738 --> 00:13:28,472
