Nitapima ukubwa wa mizigo yangu nyumbani.

285
00:13:52,710 --> 00:13:56,889
Hadi sentimita 160, hauvihitaji uhifadhi.

286
00:13:56,913 --> 00:14:01,480
Kwa wakati huo, nitaiweka kwenye rafu ya juu.

287
00:14:01,503 --> 00:14:04,240
Ndiyo, utaiweka juu.

288
00:14:04,263 --> 00:14:05,946
Nimeelewa.

289
00:14:05,969 --> 00:14:07,836
Vizuri sana.

290
00:14:07,859 --> 00:14:09,592
Nitakuwa makini.

291
00:14:09,615 --> 00:14:12,817
Furahia safari yako!

292
00:14:12,841 --> 00:14:14,848
Asante sana.

293
00:14:14,872 --> 00:14:16,605
Nitakuenda sasa.

294
00:14:16,628 --> 00:14:18,862
Nenda salama.

295
00:14:18,885 --> 00:14:20,385
Mandhari 7: Jinsi ya Kununua Tiketi ya Treni

296
00:14:20,385 --> 00:14:22,060
Samahani.

297
00:14:22,083 --> 00:14:24,725
Ninataka kununua tiketi.

298
00:14:24,748 --> 00:14:26,382
Karibu.

299
00:14:26,405 --> 00:14:28,771
Unaenda wapi?

300
00:14:28,794 --> 00:14:32,165
Ninataka kwenda Tokyo hadi Kyoto.

301
00:14:32,189 --> 00:14:34,756
Unataka treni ya saa ngapi leo?

302
00:14:34,779 --> 00:14:38,312
Nitapenda treni ya saa nne asubuhi.

303
00:14:38,335 --> 00:14:39,902
Ndiyo.

304
00:14:39,925 --> 00:14:43,613
Kuna treni ya Nozomi inayotoka saa nne na dakika saba asubuhi.

305
00:14:43,636 --> 00:14:45,836
Watu wawili wazima.

306
00:14:45,859 --> 00:14:47,293
Ndiyo.

307
00:14:47,316 --> 00:14:48,920
Ni kiti kilichowekwa, ndiyo.

308
00:14:48,943 --> 00:14:52,677
Nina mizigo mikubwa miwili.

309
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:56,833
Mizigo yako ni kubwa zaidi ya sentimita 160?

310
00:14:56,856 --> 00:14:58,223
Ndiyo.

311
00:14:58,246 --> 00:15:01,012
Ni sentimita 180.

312
00:15:01,035 --> 00:15:04,878
Basi, tutakupa kiti cha mizigo mikubwa.

313
00:15:04,902 --> 00:15:07,573
Kiti hicho ni cha aina gani?

314
00:15:07,597 --> 00:15:10,453
Ni kiti cha nyuma kabisa.

315
00:15:10,476 --> 00:15:14,076
Utaleta mizigo nyuma ya kiti chako.

316
00:15:14,099 --> 00:15:16,739
Je, itakuwa ghali zaidi?

317
00:15:16,762 --> 00:15:19,647
Hapana, bei ni sawa.

318
00:15:19,671 --> 00:15:21,748
Bei ni sawa?

319
00:15:21,772 --> 00:15:23,779
Ninashukuru sana!

320
00:15:23,802 --> 00:15:26,936
Tutakupa viti vya D na E.

321
00:15:26,959 --> 00:15:29,374
Viti viwili vya kando.

322
00:15:29,397 --> 00:15:32,335
Napenda kiti karibu na dirisha.

323
00:15:32,358 --> 00:15:35,170
Kiti cha E kiko karibu na dirisha.

324
00:15:35,193 --> 00:15:38,281
Nitapenda kiti hicho.

325
00:15:38,305 --> 00:15:41,472
Bei kwa mtu mmoja ni shilingi kumi na nne elfu.

326
00:15:41,495 --> 00:15:44,392
Kwa watu wawili ni shilingi ishirini na nane elfu, ndiyo.

327
00:15:44,416 --> 00:15:45,709
Ndiyo.

328
00:15:45,732 --> 00:15:48,299
Shilingi ishirini na nane elfu.

329
00:15:48,322 --> 00:15:50,289
Nitamlipa kwa kadi.

330
00:15:50,312 --> 00:15:53,602
Tafadhali pigia kadi yako hapa.

331
00:15:53,625 --> 00:15:54,825
Ndiyo.

332
00:15:54,848 --> 00:15:57,421
Tiketi zitatoka nne.

333
00:15:57,445 --> 00:15:59,582
Kwa mtu mmoja ni mbili, ndiyo.

334
00:15:59,605 --> 00:16:00,901
Ndiyo.

335
00:16:00,924 --> 00:16:04,339
Tafadhali weka tiketi mbili pamoja kwenye lango la kukagua tiketi.

336
00:16:04,363 --> 00:16:05,999
Nimeelewa.

337
00:16:06,022 --> 00:16:07,869
Nitaziweka mbili.

338
00:16:07,893 --> 00:16:11,362
Treni itatoka kwenye platifomu ya 16.

339
00:16:11,386 --> 00:16:14,031
Mizigo nitaiweka wapi?

340
00:16:14,054 --> 00:16:17,288
Tafadhali weka mizigo yako nyuma ya kiti chako.

341
00:16:17,311 --> 00:16:18,444
Ndiyo.

342
00:16:18,467 --> 00:16:20,555
Nitaziweka nyuma.

343
00:16:20,579 --> 00:16:24,184
Tafadhali andika jina lako kwenye mizigo yako.

344
00:16:24,207 --> 00:16:25,374
Ndiyo.

345
00:16:25,397 --> 00:16:27,771
Nitaweka karatasi ya jina.

346
00:16:27,794 --> 00:16:29,761
Hii ndiyo mwisho.

347
00:16:29,784 --> 00:16:31,451
Asante sana.

348
00:16:31,474 --> 00:16:34,147
Safari njema!

349
00:16:34,171 --> 00:16:35,671
Mandhari 8: Jinsi ya Kubadilisha Wakati wa Tiketi ya Treni

350
00:16:35,671 --> 00:16:41,004
Samahani, ningependa kubadilisha wakati wa tiketi yangu.

351
00:16:41,027 --> 00:16:45,106
Ndiyo, unaweza kufanya hivyo kwenye mashine pale.

352
00:16:45,130 --> 00:16:50,263
Nitabonyeza English kwenye skrini.

353
00:16:50,286 --> 00:16:53,890
Ndiyo, skrini itakuwa kwa Kiingereza.

354
00:16:53,914 --> 00:16:57,767
Nitabonyeza kubadilisha wakati.

355
00:16:57,791 --> 00:17:03,087
Sawa. Kisha, tafadhali weka tiketi unayomiliki ndani.

356
00:17:03,110 --> 00:17:05,977
Nitaiweka hapa.

357
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,538
Ndiyo, tiketi imeingia.

358
00:17:09,561 --> 00:17:14,596
Nitabadilisha treni ya saa tano mchana kuwa saa sita mchana.

359
00:17:14,619 --> 00:17:17,597
Mara ya kwanza ni bure.

360
00:17:17,621 --> 00:17:19,387
Bila malipo?

361
00:17:19,410 --> 00:17:21,777
Ninashukuru sana!

362
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:25,210
Chagua treni ya saa sita mchana.

363
00:17:25,233 --> 00:17:29,636
Nitachukua treni ya 'Nozomi' inayotoka saa sita na dakika tano.

364
00:17:29,659 --> 00:17:32,798
Una mizigo mikubwa?

365
00:17:32,822 --> 00:17:37,316
Ndiyo, nina mizigo mikubwa sana.

366
00:17:37,339 --> 00:17:42,106
Bonyeza kitufe cha kiti cha mizigo mikubwa.

367
00:17:42,129 --> 00:17:44,781
Ndiyo, nimebonyeza.

368
00:17:44,804 --> 00:17:50,804
Viti vya nyuma zaidi, 15D na 15E, vipo wazi.

369
00:17:50,827 --> 00:17:54,760
Nitachukua viti 15D na 15E.

370
00:17:54,783 --> 00:17:58,021
Viti vya kuweka mizigo nyuma, ndivyo?

371
00:17:58,045 --> 00:18:01,479
Bonyeza kitufe cha kuthibitisha.

372
00:18:01,501 --> 00:18:03,068
Nimebonyeza.

373
00:18:03,091 --> 00:18:05,986
Je, nitahitaji kulipa?

374
00:18:06,010 --> 00:18:09,029
Hapana, hautahitaji kulipa.

375
00:18:09,052 --> 00:18:11,185
Vizuri sana.

376
00:18:11,208 --> 00:18:14,475
Tiketi mpya inatoka sasa.

377
00:18:14,498 --> 00:18:16,665
Tiketi imetoka.

378
00:18:16,688 --> 00:18:20,654
Tiketi ya zamani itaingia ndani ya mashine.

379
00:18:20,677 --> 00:18:26,811
Kwenye tiketi mpya kuna maandishi ya 'mizigo mikubwa'.

380
00:18:26,834 --> 00:18:29,567
Umefanya vizuri sana!

381
00:18:29,590 --> 00:18:33,323
Una saa moja hadi treni itakapoondoka.

382
00:18:33,346 --> 00:18:36,039
Pumzika kidogo kwenye kafe.

383
00:18:36,062 --> 00:18:38,940
Nitununua chai na kusubiri.

384
00:18:38,964 --> 00:18:42,968
Treni itaondoka kwenye platifomu ya 16.

385
00:18:42,992 --> 00:18:46,562
Ndiyo, nitaenda kwenye platifomu ya 16.

386
00:18:46,586 --> 00:18:50,828
Ingiza tiketi mpya kwenye lango la kukagua tiketi.

387
00:18:50,851 --> 00:18:52,823
Nimeelewa.

388
00:18:52,847 --> 00:18:58,013
Weka mizigo yako nyuma ya kiti cha 15.

389
00:18:58,036 --> 00:19:00,674
Nitakumbuka.

390
00:19:00,697 --> 00:19:03,180
Safari njema!

391
00:19:03,204 --> 00:19:04,704
Sehemu ya 9: Jinsi ya Kuweka Mizigo Kwenye Kiti / Jinsi ya Kuweka Mizigo Kwenye Kiti

392
00:19:04,704 --> 00:19:06,538
Samahani.

393
00:19:06,562 --> 00:19:10,928
Wapi naweza kuweka mizigo yangu mikubwa?

394
00:19:10,951 --> 00:19:13,801
Una kiti gani?

395
00:19:13,825 --> 00:19:18,625
Kiti cha 15D na 15E.

396
00:19:18,648 --> 00:19:21,685
Nyuma ya kiti cha 15.

397
00:19:21,708 --> 00:19:24,515
Nyuma ya kiti, ndivyo?

398
00:19:24,539 --> 00:19:25,872
Ndiyo,

399
00:19:25,895 --> 00:19:29,179
Weka suitcase yako huko.

400
00:19:29,203 --> 00:19:32,272
Je, naweza kuweka mbili?

401
00:19:32,295 --> 00:19:33,582
Ndiyo,

402
00:19:33,605 --> 00:19:36,438
Ndiyo, unaweza kuweka mbili.

403
00:19:36,461 --> 00:19:38,530
Je, zitanguka?

404
00:19:38,554 --> 00:19:41,032
Simamisha gurudumu.

405
00:19:41,055 --> 00:19:42,702
Nimesimamisha.

406
00:19:42,726 --> 00:19:45,560
Sasa ni salama.

407
00:19:45,583 --> 00:19:48,755
Je, utafunga mizigo na kufuli?

408
00:19:48,778 --> 00:19:52,218
Ninahangaika, basi funga kwa kufuli.

409
00:19:52,242 --> 00:19:53,575
Ndiyo,

410
00:19:53,598 --> 00:19:55,798
Nitafunga kwa kufuli.

411
00:19:55,821 --> 00:19:59,754
Baada ya kuweka mizigo, keti kwenye kiti chako.

412
00:19:59,777 --> 00:20:03,111
Nitaketi kwenye kiti cha 15D.

413
00:20:03,134 --> 00:20:05,667
Pumzika kwa utulivu.

414
00:20:05,690 --> 00:20:09,490
Je, kuna Wi-Fi kwenye treni?

415
00:20:09,513 --> 00:20:10,880
Ndiyo,

416
00:20:10,903 --> 00:20:13,269
Kuna Wi-Fi bure.

417
00:20:13,292 --> 00:20:16,059
Nitaunganisha simu yangu.

418
00:20:16,082 --> 00:20:19,649
Bonyeza kitufe cha 'ndio' kwenye skrini.

419
00:20:19,671 --> 00:20:22,647
Umeunganishwa na mtandao.

420
00:20:22,670 --> 00:20:26,165
Chini ya miguu yako kuna plagi ya umeme pia.

421
00:20:26,188 --> 00:20:28,155
Nitachaji simu yangu.

422
00:20:28,178 --> 00:20:29,611
Ndiyo,

423
00:20:29,634 --> 00:20:32,034
Unaweza kuchaji simu yako.

424
