Mtu anayeuza huja tu kwa gari la kijani (green car).

426
00:20:38,906 --> 00:20:43,439
Naweza kununua bento katika kiti hiki?

427
00:20:43,462 --> 00:20:46,829
Unaweza kuagiza kwa simu yako.

428
00:20:46,852 --> 00:20:50,885
Tutatumia nambari ya QR iliyo kwenye kiti.

429
00:20:50,908 --> 00:20:51,908
Ndiyo,

430
00:20:51,931 --> 00:20:55,498
Unaweza kununua aiskrimu na kahawa pia.

431
00:20:55,521 --> 00:20:58,454
Nitanunua aiskrimu.

432
00:20:58,477 --> 00:21:01,611
Aiskrimu tamu ya Shinkansen!

433
00:21:01,634 --> 00:21:03,671
Nitasubiri kwa hamu.

434
00:21:03,694 --> 00:21:07,111
Bado masaa mawili mpaka Kyoto.

435
00:21:07,135 --> 00:21:09,501
Gari moshi hii ni kimya sana, sivyo?

436
00:21:09,524 --> 00:21:12,658
Enda nikupigie simu unapotaka msaada.

437
00:21:12,681 --> 00:21:14,361
Asante sana.

438
00:21:14,384 --> 00:21:17,078
Safari njema!

439
00:21:17,102 --> 00:21:18,602
Sehemu ya 10: Kuhifadhi na Ada za Mizigo Kubwa

440
00:21:18,602 --> 00:21:23,735
Samahani, sijui nitakapoweka suitcase yangu.

441
