Ndiyo, inafikia sentimita 180.

445
00:21:36,483 --> 00:21:41,735
Mizigo yenye zaidi ya sentimita 160 ni mizigo kubwa sana.

446
00:21:41,759 --> 00:21:45,765
Je, ulikuwa unahitaji kuhifadhi kabla ya kupanda?

447
00:21:45,788 --> 00:21:49,365
Ndiyo, uhifadhi unahitajika.

448
