451
00:21:58,683 --> 00:22:01,097
Shilingi elfu moja.

452
00:22:01,121 --> 00:22:03,454
Utalipa kwa pesa taslimu?

453
00:22:03,477 --> 00:22:07,013
Ndiyo, nitalipa kwa pesa taslimu.

454
00:22:07,037 --> 00:22:09,437
Nakupokea shilingi elfu moja.

455
00:22:09,460 --> 00:22:11,526
Hii ni risiti yako.

456
00:22:11,549 --> 00:22:14,216
Nimepokea risiti.

457
00:22:14,239 --> 00:22:17,520
Mizigo nitaiweka wapi?

458
00:22:17,544 --> 00:22:23,121
Weka mizigo yako nyuma ya kiti cha namba 15 kilicho mwisho.

459
00:22:23,145 --> 00:22:26,804
Nyuma ya kiti cha namba 15, ndiyo?

460
00:22:26,827 --> 00:22:30,795
Weka mahali panapokuwa na nafasi.

461
00:22:30,819 --> 00:22:33,552
Nimeweka mizigo yangu.

462
00:22:33,575 --> 00:22:35,950
Simamisha gurudumu.

463
00:22:35,973 --> 00:22:37,977
Nimesimamisha.

464
00:22:38,001 --> 00:22:42,481
Mara inayofuata, tafadhali hifadhi kabla ya kupanda.

465
00:22:42,505 --> 00:22:45,238
Je, uhifadhi ni bure?

466
00:22:45,261 --> 00:22:48,340
Ndiyo, ni bure.

467
00:22:48,364 --> 00:22:51,536
Naweza kuhifadhi kwa mtandao?

468
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:55,802
Unaweza kuhifadhi kwa mtandao au kwa programu.

469
00:22:55,825 --> 00:22:58,911
