Ni mfumo uitwao Face Express.

705
00:34:52,331 --> 00:34:57,390
Unaweza kupanda ndege bila kuonyesha pasipoti.

706
00:34:57,414 --> 00:35:01,293
Je, unaweza kupita bila pasipoti?

707
00:35:01,316 --> 00:35:03,516
Ni ajabu sana!

708
00:35:03,539 --> 00:35:08,187
Kwanza, piga picha uso wako kwa mashine.

709
00:35:08,210 --> 00:35:11,744
Pasipoti na uso ni sawa.

710
00:35:11,767 --> 00:35:17,367
Baada ya kupiga picha, kuweka mizigo kunakuwa kwa haraka.

711
00:35:17,390 --> 00:35:21,723
Hauhitaji kuonyesha pasipoti, ni rahisi sana.

712
00:35:21,746 --> 00:35:25,179
Muda wa kupiga foleni utakuwa mfupi.

713
00:35:25,202 --> 00:35:29,216
Unaweza kupita kwenye geti haraka.

714
00:35:29,240 --> 00:35:32,606
Je, naweza kutumia hii Narita au Haneda?

715
00:35:32,629 --> 00:35:36,829
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia hii Narita na Haneda.

716
00:35:36,852 --> 00:35:39,858
Je, mtu yeyote anaweza kutumia?

717
00:35:39,882 --> 00:35:44,449
Kama una pasipoti yenye chipu ya IC, unaweza kutumia.

718
00:35:44,472 --> 00:35:48,838
Pasipoti yangu ina chipu ya IC.

719
00:35:48,861 --> 00:35:52,117
Basi unaweza kutumia.

720
00:35:52,141 --> 00:35:55,144
Je, picha ya uso ni salama?

721
00:35:55,167 --> 00:35:58,800
Inatoweka baada ya kupanda ndege.

722
00:35:58,823 --> 00:36:01,071
Inatoweka mara moja?

723
00:36:01,095 --> 00:36:03,180
Ni salama sana.

724
00:36:03,203 --> 00:36:05,537
Mfumo huu ni salama.

725
00:36:05,560 --> 00:36:08,626
Je, ni kufikia kamera tu kwenye geti?

726
00:36:08,649 --> 00:36:12,516
Ndiyo, ni kuziona kamera tu ndipo geti itafunguka.

727
00:36:12,539 --> 00:36:15,907
Hauhitaji kutafuta pasipoti.

728
00:36:15,931 --> 00:36:19,141
Ni vizuri hasa wakati una mizigo mingi.

729
00:36:19,164 --> 00:36:23,242
Ningependa kutumia hii wakati nitaenda nchini next time.

730
00:36:23,266 --> 00:36:27,141
Ni rahisi, basi jaribu kutumia.

731
00:36:27,165 --> 00:36:29,854
Kuna wafanyakazi karibu pia.

732
00:36:29,877 --> 00:36:33,611
Asante kwa kunijulisha habari hizi.

733
00:36:33,634 --> 00:36:36,800
Safari njema kwenda nyumbani.

734
00:36:36,823 --> 00:36:40,057
Nitaipiga picha kwenye uwanja wa ndege na kuonyesha.

735
00:36:40,080 --> 00:36:42,121
Nitasubiri kwa hamu.

736
00:36:42,144 --> 00:36:44,011
Nenda salama.

737
00:36:44,034 --> 00:36:45,534
Sehemu ya 17: Jinsi ya Kutumia Mfumo wa Kutambua Uso

738
00:36:45,534 --> 00:36:47,534
Samahani.

739
00:36:47,557 --> 00:36:51,157
Ningependa kutumia mfumo wa kutambua uso.

740
00:36:51,180 --> 00:36:52,349
Ndiyo.

741
00:36:52,373 --> 00:36:55,606
Unaweza kufanya hivi kwa mashine hii.

742
00:36:55,629 --> 00:36:59,700
Bonyeza kitufe cha Face Express.

743
00:36:59,724 --> 00:37:02,214
Nimebonyeza kitufe.

744
00:37:02,237 --> 00:37:08,771
Chagua Kiingereza upande wa kulia wa skrini, kisha bonyeza 'Ndiyo'.

745
00:37:08,794 --> 00:37:11,081
Nimebonyeza 'Ndiyo'.

746
00:37:11,104 --> 00:37:15,556
Kisha, fungua pasipoti yako.

747
00:37:15,580 --> 00:37:19,260
Nitaiweka ukurasa wa picha.

748
00:37:19,283 --> 00:37:21,759
Imeisoma kwa sauti 'pi'.

749
00:37:21,783 --> 00:37:25,949
Jina na nambari zimeonekana.

750
00:37:25,972 --> 00:37:28,510
Bonyeza 'Thibitisha'.

751
00:37:28,534 --> 00:37:31,134
Nimebonyeza 'Thibitisha'.

752
00:37:31,157 --> 00:37:34,690
Sasa, angalia kamera.

753
00:37:34,713 --> 00:37:38,580
Nitaondoa kofia na barakoa.

754
00:37:38,603 --> 00:37:42,648
Ndiyo, ondoa kofia na barakoa.

755
00:37:42,671 --> 00:37:46,129
Nitaangalia kamera kwa moja kwa moja.

756
00:37:46,153 --> 00:37:49,319
Mashine itaipiga picha yako.

757
00:37:49,342 --> 00:37:50,789
Ndiyo.

758
00:37:50,813 --> 00:37:54,379
Imefanya sauti ya 'pasha'.

759
00:37:54,402 --> 00:37:56,887
Picha ya uso imemalizika.

760
00:37:56,911 --> 00:38:00,152
Je, hii ndio mwisho?

761
00:38:00,176 --> 00:38:01,822
Ndiyo.

762
00:38:01,846 --> 00:38:04,379
Tiketi itatoka.

763
00:38:04,402 --> 00:38:06,569
Tiketi imetoka.

764
00:38:06,592 --> 00:38:10,759
Kuna alama ya Face Express.

765
00:38:10,782 --> 00:38:13,515
Kuna alama ya buluu.

766
00:38:13,538 --> 00:38:18,572
Kwa hii unaweza kwenda kwa ukaguzi wa mizigo kwa kutumia uso tu.

767
00:38:18,596 --> 00:38:23,529
Hauhitaji kuonyesha pasipoti, ni rahisi sana.

768
00:38:23,552 --> 00:38:27,485
Je, naweza kutumia mashine hii kwa mizigo yangu?

769
00:38:27,508 --> 00:38:28,927
Ndiyo.

770
00:38:28,951 --> 00:38:32,963
Ndiyo, unaweza kutumia ile mashine pale.

771
00:38:32,986 --> 00:38:35,720
Nitakwenda kuweka mizigo yangu.

772
00:38:35,743 --> 00:38:37,623
Ilikuwa rahisi sana.

773
00:38:37,647 --> 00:38:39,144
Asante sana.

774
00:38:39,167 --> 00:38:41,767
Safari njema!

775
00:38:41,790 --> 00:38:43,957
Safari njema!

776
00:38:43,980 --> 00:38:45,480
Sehemu ya 18: Jinsi ya Kuweka Mizigo kwa Nija Yako Mwenyewe

777
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:47,446
Samahani.

778
00:38:47,469 --> 00:38:51,755
Je, naweza kuweka mizigo yangu mwenyewe?

779
00:38:51,779 --> 00:38:52,913
Ndiyo.

780
00:38:52,936 --> 00:38:55,869
Tafadhali, nenda kwenye mashine hii.

781
00:38:55,892 --> 00:38:59,460
Hii ni mara yangu ya kwanza kuweka mizigo mwenyewe.

782
00:38:59,484 --> 00:39:01,951
Bonyeza kitufe cha 'Anza'.

783
00:39:01,975 --> 00:39:04,341
Nimebonyeza kitufe cha 'Anza'.

784
00:39:04,364 --> 00:39:07,164
Tazama kwenye kamera iliyo juu.

785
00:39:07,187 --> 00:39:11,164
Nimechukua picha ya uso wangu sasa hivi.

786
00:39:11,188 --> 00:39:15,121
Kamera itakujua uso wako unapoangalia.

787
00:39:15,144 --> 00:39:17,724
Jina lako limeonekana kwenye skrini.

788
00:39:17,747 --> 00:39:20,759
Weka mzigo wako kwenye mashine.

789
00:39:20,782 --> 00:39:23,449
Nitaweka katikati.

790
00:39:23,472 --> 00:39:24,872
Ndiyo.

791
00:39:24,895 --> 00:39:27,497
Tafadhali, weka upande.

792
00:39:27,520 --> 00:39:29,753
Uzito umeonekana.

793
00:39:29,776 --> 00:39:32,230
Kilogramu kumi na nane.

794
00:39:32,254 --> 00:39:34,029
Je, ni sawa?

795
00:39:34,053 --> 00:39:38,391
Hadi kilogramu ishirini na tatu, ni sawa kabisa.

796
00:39:38,415 --> 00:39:40,415
Nimefuraahi.

797
00:39:40,438 --> 00:39:43,320
Je, kuna vitu hatari?

798
00:39:43,343 --> 00:39:46,786
Je, una kompyuta au betri ndani?

799
00:39:46,810 --> 00:39:49,843
Betri iko ndani ya begi langu.

800
00:39:49,866 --> 00:39:53,550
Hauwezi kuweka betri kwenye mashine.

801
00:39:53,574 --> 00:39:55,418
Nimeelewa.

802
00:39:55,441 --> 00:39:57,730
Nitaiweka mimi mwenyewe.

803
00:39:57,754 --> 00:40:00,987
Bonyeza 'Ndio' sasa.

804
00:40:01,010 --> 00:40:03,943
Stika ndefu itatoka.

805
00:40:03,966 --> 00:40:05,843
Stika imetoka.

806
00:40:05,867 --> 00:40:09,733
Funga stika kwenye mpini wa mzigo wako.

807
00:40:09,756 --> 00:40:12,290
Nitafunga kwenye mpini.

808
00:40:12,313 --> 00:40:14,768
Umefunga vizuri sana.

809
00:40:14,791 --> 00:40:17,078
Nifanye nini sasa?

810
00:40:17,101 --> 00:40:19,901
Bonyeza kitufe cha 'Maliza'.

811
00:40:19,924 --> 00:40:22,724
Nimebonyeza kitufe cha 'Maliza'.

812
00:40:22,747 --> 00:40:25,814
Mzigo wako utaingia ndani sasa.

813
00:40:25,837 --> 00:40:28,104
Mzigo umeingia.

814
00:40:28,126 --> 00:40:30,335
Risiti itatoka.

815
00:40:30,359 --> 00:40:32,492
Nimepokea karatasi.

816
00:40:32,515 --> 00:40:35,163
Tunashauri uifanye bidhaa hii muhimu iwe salama.

817
00:40:35,187 --> 00:40:38,154
Nitaweka kwenye kifurushi cha pasipoti.

818
00:40:38,177 --> 00:40:40,344
Imechukua dakika moja tu.

819
00:40:40,367 --> 00:40:44,137
Sasa nenda kwenye ukaguzi wa mizigo.

820
00:40:44,160 --> 00:40:45,649
Asante sana.

821
00:40:45,673 --> 00:41:05,939
Safari njema.

822
00:41:05,962 --> 00:41:07,462
Sehemu ya 19: Utaratibu wa Kutambua Uso

823
00:41:07,462 --> 00:41:09,229
Samahani.

824
00:41:09,252 --> 00:41:12,252
Je, ukaguzi wa mizigo ni hapa?

825
00:41:12,275 --> 00:41:15,343
Ndiyo, ni hapa.

826
00:41:15,367 --> 00:41:18,501
Nimechukua picha ya uso wangu sasa hivi.

827
00:41:18,524 --> 00:41:21,957
Tafadhali, nenda upande wa kulia.

828
00:41:21,980 --> 00:41:24,247
Nitakwenda upande wa kulia.

829
00:41:24,271 --> 00:41:28,604
Hakuna mtu, kwa hivyo unaweza kwenda mara moja.

830
00:41:28,627 --> 00:41:31,361
Je, ninaonyesha pasipoti?

831
00:41:31,384 --> 00:41:35,317
Hapana, angalia tu kwenye kamera.

832
00:41:35,340 --> 00:41:38,150
Simama kwenye sehemu ya njano.

833
00:41:38,173 --> 00:41:41,540
Nitaangalia kamera kwa moja kwa moja.

834
00:41:41,563 --> 00:41:44,455
Nitakutoa barakoa na kofia yako.

835
00:41:44,479 --> 00:41:48,497
Ndio, sasa naona uso wako.

836
00:41:48,520 --> 00:41:50,361
Mlango umefunguka.

837
00:41:50,385 --> 00:41:52,554
Ingia ndani.

838
00:41:52,577 --> 00:41:57,211
Hauhitaji kuonyesha pasipoti, kwa hiyo ni haraka.

839
00:41:57,234 --> 00:42:00,167
Tutafanya ukaguzi wa vitu vyote unavyobeba.

840
00:42:00,190 --> 00:42:03,201
Weka mizigo yako kwenye sanduku.

841
00:42:03,224 --> 00:42:05,957
Kompyuta yako itashughulikiwaje?

842
00:42:05,980 --> 00:42:09,648
Toa kompyuta yako katika mfuko.

843
00:42:09,672 --> 00:42:12,039
Ndio, nimeitoa.

844
00:42:12,062 --> 00:42:15,197
Kuna vinywaji ndani?

845
00:42:15,220 --> 00:42:17,587
Kuna maji.

846
00:42:17,611 --> 00:42:22,891
Hauwezi kubeba maji zaidi ya mia moja ya mililita.

847
00:42:22,915 --> 00:42:25,166
Tupatie hapa.

848
00:42:25,190 --> 00:42:28,123
Tafadhali weka kwenye takataka pale.

849
00:42:28,146 --> 00:42:31,146
Vua jaki nzito tafadhali.

850
00:42:31,169 --> 00:42:33,838
Toa pesa zote kwenye mfuko wako.

851
00:42:33,862 --> 00:42:37,157
Nitakuweka simu yako kwenye sanduku pia.

852
00:42:37,180 --> 00:42:42,146
Ndio. Vua viatu vyenye soli nzito navaa viatu vya ndani.

853
00:42:42,169 --> 00:42:44,148
Nimeelewa.

854
00:42:44,172 --> 00:42:48,105
Sasa, pita kwenye geti hili.

855
00:42:48,129 --> 00:42:49,729
Ninapita.

856
00:42:49,752 --> 00:42:53,595
Hakukuwa na sauti, basi ni salama.

857
00:42:53,619 --> 00:42:56,790
Chukua mizigo yako.

858
00:42:56,813 --> 00:42:58,226
Asante sana.

859
00:42:58,250 --> 00:43:00,703
Endelea kuelekea ndege.

860
00:43:00,726 --> 00:43:03,093
Safari njema.

861
00:43:03,116 --> 00:43:04,616
Sehemu ya 20: Mchakato wa Ukaguzi wa Pasipoti

862
00:43:04,616 --> 00:43:06,508
Samahani.

863
00:43:06,531 --> 00:43:09,824
Ukaguzi wa pasipoti ni hapa?

864
00:43:09,847 --> 00:43:12,847
Ndiyo, ni hapa.

865
00:43:12,870 --> 00:43:16,404
Naweza kupita kwenye mlango wa kujitegemea?

866
00:43:16,427 --> 00:43:20,870
Kama pasipoti yako ni ya IC, unaweza kupita.

867
00:43:20,893 --> 00:43:23,826
Nitakwenda kwenye mlango wa kujitegemea.

868
00:43:23,849 --> 00:43:26,849
Fungua ukurasa wa picha.

869
00:43:26,872 --> 00:43:29,239
Nimeifungua.

870
00:43:29,262 --> 00:43:32,870
Weka pasipoti chini kwenye mashine.

871
00:43:32,893 --> 00:43:35,260
Ninaweka pasipoti.

872
00:43:35,283 --> 00:43:38,087
Pasipoti imetambuliwa.

873
00:43:38,110 --> 00:43:42,943
Tazama kwenye kamera kwenye skrini.

874
00:43:42,966 --> 00:43:44,400
Ndiyo.

875
00:43:44,423 --> 00:43:48,456
Vua kofia na miwani, tazama kamera.

876
00:43:48,479 --> 00:43:51,212
Nitavua miwani.

877
00:43:51,235 --> 00:43:54,202
Tunatazama picha ya uso wako.

878
00:43:54,225 --> 00:43:57,706
Ndio, mlango umefunguka.

879
00:43:57,729 --> 00:43:59,814
Endelea tu.

880
00:43:59,838 --> 00:44:02,304
Nitachukua pasipoti yangu.

881
00:44:02,327 --> 00:44:04,861
Usisahau.

882
00:44:04,884 --> 00:44:09,050
Mlango wa kujitegemea hauweki stampu.

883
00:44:09,073 --> 00:44:11,724
Ningependa stampu kwa ajili ya kumbukumbu.

884
00:44:11,747 --> 00:44:14,844
Nitakupa stampu.

885
00:44:14,868 --> 00:44:16,913
Hapa tafadhali.

886
00:44:16,936 --> 00:44:18,709
Ndio, tafadhali.

887
00:44:18,733 --> 00:44:21,899
Nimeweka stampu kwenye pasipoti yako.

888
00:44:21,922 --> 00:44:23,489
Asante sana.

889
00:44:23,512 --> 00:44:26,120
Nimefanya manunuzi.

890
00:44:26,143 --> 00:44:29,479
Je, unahitaji kuonyesha risiti ya ushuru wa kutozwa?

891
00:44:29,503 --> 00:44:34,070
Kwa sababu data imeingizwa, hata usionyeshe hakuna matatizo.

892
00:44:34,093 --> 00:44:36,909
Mchakato ni rahisi sana, sivyo?

893
00:44:36,932 --> 00:44:40,202
Umepita upesi sana!

894
00:44:40,226 --> 00:44:43,260
Nitakwenda kupanda ndege kwenye ghuba ya ngapi?

895
00:44:43,283 --> 00:44:46,582
Tazama upande wa kulia wa tiketi yako.

896
00:44:46,606 --> 00:44:49,385
Imeandikwa ghuba sitini na tano.

897
00:44:49,409 --> 00:44:53,461
Pinda kushoto na uende kwa dakika tano.

898
00:44:53,484 --> 00:44:56,051
Je, una muda wa kufika ndege?

899
00:44:56,074 --> 00:44:58,686
Bado una saa moja.

900
00:44:58,709 --> 00:45:01,309
Tafadhali nunua bidhaa kwenye duka.

901
00:45:01,332 --> 00:45:03,466
Nitainunua zawadi kidogo.

902
00:45:03,489 --> 00:45:06,061
Uwe na safari njema!

903
00:45:06,084 --> 00:45:08,064
Ndio, asante sana.

904
00:45:08,088 --> 00:45:10,660
Safari njema.